{
  "$schema": "./node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "_comment": "Q-B1, Q-B2: the rest of the frontend (plan \u00a74: 85 %); the five modules at 100 % are stryker.config.json. npm run mutation:rest (through scripts/heavy.sh), or one module at a time with --mutate. The pure modules of Q-B2 (lib/*.ts) are measured first.",
